      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having the camera/drone sounds be tied to the same audio slide as UI is somewhat inconvenient, as it would also mute other menu noises or even notifications. And to reply to your earlier post, this canny talks about the drone sound in general being pretty harsh on the ears for anyone who is sensitive to any sounds involved with buzzing or whirring. It might also get in the way if say- you are trying to record a fight scene or music video only to have the audio polluted by that same drone noise.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
