      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. I don't like the sounds drones make. \n\nSo I had to disable them completely.\n\nI don't want to sacrifice all my UI sound effect for the drones.\n\nI'd like a toggle or a slide to change drone's volume.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
