  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The current drone sounds in the open beta have a sound effect that can be seen by others as distracting or otherwise unpleasant to listen to for varying periods of time. Changing the sound effect to something that is less obnoxious. Perhaps setting the volume for camera related sounds like the drone to their own independent slider or toggle in the settings menu or adding a mute option to whenever you have the drone out would be preferable.",
